      "writtenOn": "2021-04-05T07:32:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi Jack,\n\nI cross checked with our RIL team. They are of the view that duplicate SetPreferredDataModem would clog the datamodule thread and cause delays in processing other messages like SetupdataCallRequest, SetInitialAttachRequest, DeactivateDataCallrequest, pretty much every Data related messages would be impacted.\nIdeally framework shouldn’t be sending unwanted messages over HAL which wastes binder resources and adds additional load on the system.",
