      "writtenOn": "2021-04-12T04:58:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Susheel,\n\nIf you want to fix in frameworks, please do it in the right way. Instead of the current fix, your fix should be \u0027preventing unnecessary callings of sendRilCommands()\u0027.\n\nThere are 4 places calling sendRilCommands(). Please carefully review them one by one. For example, the one in onEvalulate(). It only got called when diffDetected is true. If you think there are corner cases that you think duplicate request could be sent when diffDetected is true, then you should fix it (i.e. making diffDetected false for that corner case).\n\nNote there are some places that sending duplicate request is intentional. For example, the one from EVENT_RADIO_CAPABILITY_CHANGED. (See the comment of the method onRadioCapChanged()).",
      "parentUuid": "fb3e4de5_e4627f0b",
      "range": {
