      "writtenOn": "2021-04-02T07:59:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If you really want to fix, then you should follow what I suggest in the serialized RIL commands CL. All should be queued as setPreferredDataModemRequest, setPreferredDataModemResponse, setPreferredDataModemRequest, setPreferredDataModemResponse....\n\nAs I said, you should ignore the duplicate request on your side, and not saying this causes so many issue on your side. From API\u0027s design perspective, calling the same set-preference-function should not cause issues.\n\nIf you don\u0027t want to serialize all the request/response, fixing this on RIL would be easier for you.",
